@startuml
title Modulock — saída temporizada com millis() modular (MOD-TIME v2.1.0)
actor "RFID / Admin autenticado" as Source
participant "ativarRelePorta()" as Activate
participant "GPIO4 relé" as Relay
participant "loop() ESP32" as Loop
participant "ModulockTimingPolicy" as Policy

Source -> Activate : pedido de abertura autorizado
Activate -> Activate : relayActivatedAtMs = uint32(millis())\nrelayActive = true
Activate -> Relay : LOW (energizado)

loop Acompanhamento a cada iteração do firmware
  Loop -> Policy : expired(relayActive, now, activatedAt, 1000)
  alt delta modular menor que 1000ms
    Policy --> Loop : false
    note over Loop : Relé continua LOW
  else duração >=1000ms (inclusive após wrap)
    Policy --> Loop : true
    Loop -> Relay : HIGH (desenergizado)
    Loop -> Loop : relayActive = false
  end
end
note over Loop,Policy
LED verde/vermelho usam a mesma regra com 2000ms.
Testes host verificam wrap; hardware real ainda pendente.
end note
@enduml
